1 REM FBCS PRT-0250
2 REM CLAIM E-8102
3 REM TYPE WARN
4 REM EXPECT 8102 110
100 REM MAT INPUT: A REPLY WITH TWO ADJACENT COMMAS IS NOT A VALID INPUT-REPLY: 8102 AND A NEW REPLY IS ASKED
101 REM FOR (10.5.5 L.6110)
105 DIM A(3)
110 MAT INPUT A
120 IF A(1) = 4 AND A(2) = 5 AND A(3) = 6 THEN PRINT "REPLY RESUPPLIED" ELSE PRINT SQR(-1)
130 END
